# Keep this repository on LF everywhere.
#
# This matters more here than in an ordinary project: Copier renders these
# source files verbatim, so a .jinja file that drifts to CRLF renders CRLF
# content into every project generated from this template. The generated
# project's own .gitattributes would eventually normalize it, but the files
# arrive wrong and any tooling run before the first commit sees them that way.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files (no EOL normalization)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
